Lardi-Trans is the largest international logistics platform that unites thousands of carriers, shippers, and forwarders from Europe and Asia. No matter you are an individual, an entrepreneur or a legal entity, everyone has access to a broad range of our services.

With Lardi-Trans mobile app you can:
- search for cargo and free transport;
- place your offers;
- easily work with your offers in the search;
- customize your filters;
- see other users’ information;
- and even more.

Over 100,000 users are working with the platform right now! Join us!
